<html>
 <head>
  <title></title>
 </head>
 <body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
  <p dir="ltr" style="text-align: center;"><img alt="REI-logo-color-r" src="{[devName:REIlogocolorr]}" style="max-width: 723.514px; width: 217.5px; height: 92px;" title="REI-logo-color-r" /></p>
  <p dir="ltr">&nbsp;</p>
  <p dir="ltr"><br /> <br /> Hello,</p>
  <p dir="ltr">I hope this emails finds you well. My team has tried to contact you several times in the recent months but hasn't been able to get in touch with you. I wanted to connect with you from our last conversation and get a better game plan together for your portfolio moving forward. If now isn't the right time, when should we revisit?&nbsp;</p>
  <p dir="ltr">An update from our end, we have made forward commitments with a few of the lenders I've included below so we can offer 5.38% interest rates at no cost to you, if one did want to buy the rate down further you could get as low as 4.75% with 3 points. As the Fed continues to drop rates it will bring more demand back into the housing market causing the prices to increase at a faster pace again. So a lot of clients are taking advantage of the lowered rate we are offering because it gets you ahead of the Fed to help your position right now and it allows you to take advantage of the growth to come.&nbsp;</p>
  <p dir="ltr">I understand now isn't the right time for everyone and that's ok. If it's not, when should we revisit? If it is, what does your available look like this week to schedule a call? If you don't want me to contact you again just say so, that's ok as well. I understand we are all at different stages of our investment cycle.</p>
  <p dir="ltr">Thanks and I look forward to better serving you.</p>
  <p dir="ltr">Best,</p>
  <p dir="ltr"><br /> Taz<br /> <br /> <br /> &nbsp;</p>
 </body>
</html>